window.products.push({"id":1141119,"name":"LONCWO LED Light Strip with Switch, 1 Meter/3.3ft 110V LED Strip Rope Light IP 65 Waterproof LED Ribbon, SMD 5050, Warm White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y+9qaInnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Please note： 1. It only can be cut in every meter along the cutting marks, without damaging the rest strips. When you cut it, it need to be insulated by insulating tape at the cutting position. 2. Please don't plug the strip without unrolling it, to avoid damaged by overheating. 3. If the LEDs still light up when switched off, simply turn the plug around and plug again so that all the LEDs do not \"glow\". 4. Turn on the led strip for few minutes so as to easier bend to different shapes. Do not turn on the light in the process of installation. 5. Keep surrounding ventilated so as not to be burned out by overheating. 6. When installing, not to exert excessive force, prevent circuit boards broken. These AC LED Strips plug directly into a wall outlet, no bulky power adapter or transformer are required. A inline fuse to protect the led strip.  Clear PVC tube makes it thicker than low-voltage led strip, but more bright, durable,and waterproof. It also easy to bend to different shapes. An even light distribution for use in kitchen counter, restaurants, bars,club,office, retail displays, reception areas, attic,stairwell, signage,garage etc. Features: Length: 1m led strip + 60cm cable Dimension: 1mX1.4cmX0.7cm LEDs Quantity: 60/m Lumen (Brightness): 10 lm/leds Working voltage: 110 V AC Waterproof:IP 65 (made sure the cable and ends were sheltered from wet weather).  Dimming: NO Installation:Plastic mounting buckles instead of easily falls off self-adhesive back tape. Package included: - led light strip - Instruction  - 1 end-cap（ in case you cut led strip down shorter） - Mounting Buckles","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y+9qaInnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LONCWO","source_asin":"B07GPSGWV9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1141119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GPSGWV9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GPSGWV9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1141120,"name":"Picnic Time Venezia Two-Bottle Wine Carrier, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811unaafi1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Picnic Time Venezia two-bottle wine tote features a sleek and stylish design made of premium leatherette with accent stitching that adds a dash of sophistication. The interior is velveteen with a folding divider and removable base which allows the tote to lay flat when not in use. The large clear window on the front creates an attractive display for the wine labels inside, adding more visual interest and elegance. Perfect as a tote to carry two bottles of wine to your next dinner party, or present as a gift, the Venezia makes any celebration extra special. Black with White Stitching.Capacity: 2 Standard bottles of wine, champagne, or spirits. Dimensions (Open): 14.75 inch x 7.25 inch x 3.25 inch(H x W x D, Approx.),Dimensions: (Folded): 14.75 inch x 7.25 inch x 0.5 inch (H x W x D, Approx.). Material: Leatherette and Velveteen","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811unaafi1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PICNIC TIME","source_asin":"B004MDR1BM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1141120","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004MDR1BM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004MDR1BM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
