window.products.push({"id":1141305,"name":"TheiaMo LED Rectangle Mirror, 30\"x22\" Double Touch Dimmable Bathroom Mirror, Wall Mounted Vanity Mirror with 45° Beveled Metal Frame, Anti-Fog Waterpr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IPykcBNjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Dimmable Bathroom Mirror】TheiaMo led bathroom mirror has front led light around, 3-color options (3000K/ 4000K/ 6000K) .You can just light touch the button to choose warm white/ natrual/ daylaight mode. And long-press the same button to dimming the brightness from 10%-100%. 【HD&Explosion-proof Mirror】This wall mounted led mirrors use SQ grade float glass, high-definition. Burst-proof, shattered glass will not be spilled out even impacted by external force, more safe and protective. 【Anti-fog&Water-prof】The LED vanity mirror has an automatic fog free function. No need to wipe the steam on the mirror manually, only touch the defogging button before a hot shower.Anti-fog function is separately controlled by a touch button, which is safe and energy-saving. IP66 waterproof rating ensures safe lighting in wet bathroom environments. The lifetime of the vanity mirror LED is 50,000 hours. 【Easy Installation】There are 2 colors of our bathroom vanity mirrors: gold, black. And 2 sizes for your choices: 30\"x22\", 36\"x28\". You could install it vertical or horizontal. The package comes with accessories to hanging the mirror, just reading the instruction carefully. 【Wide Application】Our vanity mirrors can be used in most scenes such as bathroom, fitting room, living room, make up room, etc., making the space more elegant and modern. If you have any questions about this mirror, please feel free to contact us, we will solve it for you as soon as possible. 【Kindly Note】Turn on the wall switch can only make the mirror energize, turn on/off the mirror light should be also contronlled by the switch button on the mirror.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IPykcBNjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TheiaMo","source_asin":"B0C6XY4541","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1141305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6XY4541","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6XY4541","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1141306,"name":"Erbulus 18 Oz Large Copper Turkish Greek Arabic Coffee Pot with Fortune App and Wooden Handle (6 cups), Cezve Turkish Coffee Pot, Ibrik, Briki Greek C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617Vl3g-PaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Style: Hammered copper large Turkish coffee pot with different handmade motifs. This coffee pot is also known as ibrik or cezve in the Turkish culture and widely used in Arab culture as Arabic coffee pot and in Greek culture is called a briki. Made in Turkey. Size and Color: Height 4.7’’ (12cm). Diameter at base 3.9’’ (10cm). Diameter at top 3.1 (8cm). Handle length 7.8’’ (20cm) Capacity 18 oz (530 ml) - 6 persons. A wooden spoon is included as a gift. Traditional Turkish Coffee Maker: Copper coffee pot is the most preferred cezve coffee pot type for Turkish coffee. Enamel turkish coffee pot helps to maintain the aroma of coffee with its high thermal conductivity. You can use our free recipe prepared for our customers included in our products. Material: Made by master craftsmen of Turkish handicrafts in copper works. The turkishcoffee pot is handmade, the body is marked copper and the handle is wood. The bottom side made of hammered copper and the inside is coated with a non-reactive tin layer. Since this is a handmade product, do not put in dishwasher. Use: You can use in ceramic, electric and gas cookers and also on hot sand. Practical mouth helps to dropp liquids easily. In addition to turkish coffee, you can use this antique coffee pot for cooking other drinks such as milk and hot chocolate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617Vl3g-PaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Erbulus","source_asin":"B092W9PKN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1141306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092W9PKN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092W9PKN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
