window.products.push({"id":1141342,"name":"HomeElegance Bathroom Hardware Set 4 Piece Wall Mounted Shelves Stainless Steel Towel Bars Toilet Paper Holder Robe Hook Bathroom Fixture Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zuGTWTotL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Items included: A bathroom hardware set, including a single-bar towel shelf(23.6’’*2.95’’*1.18”), a towel bar(10.62”*2.95”*1.18”), a toilet paper holder(6.69”*2.95”*1.18”) and a robe hook(2.36”*2.95*1.18”), 2 sets installation tools(Allen Wrench and expansion screws) Item Package Weight: 3.65lb/Set Material: Food grade Premium SUS 304 Stainless Steel, coated with paint.No allergy or any other damage would be caused. About SUS 304 Stainless Steel: SUS 304 Stainless Steel is a Japan production standard. It is a high strength, strong heat resistance, strong corrosion resistance Austenitic stainless steel.Commonly used in food, chemicals, auto parts, medical materials and many other fields. Load bearing: Heavy duty bathroom accessory set, bears up to 30kg(66lbs) each item. Applicable Occassions: Bathroom, hotels,etc.for use of hanging towels, robes, clothes, toilet paper,etc. Installation Manual: 1. Check the mounting hardware before your installation. Mounting bracket comes with products. 2. Put mounting bracket on wall in desired location. 3. Mark two points on the wall where you will drill the screws. Make sure that the holes are in your desired position. 4. Drill 2 holes on the marked places. If the wall is made of wood, you can directly install the mounting bracket to the wall. 5. Use your hammer to hit the anchor into the holes, and use screwdriver to fix the bracket on the wall with screws. 6. Match the product with mounting bracket and use the Allen wrench to fasten the screw. Warranty,Return & Refund: We offer a limited 2-year warranty period against manufacturer defect.Please return the item if you are not satisfied. Full refund will be made asap. Please feel free to contact us if you have any question with the product or installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zuGTWTotL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeElegance","source_asin":"B07GQLMLFX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1141342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GQLMLFX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GQLMLFX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
