window.products.push({"id":1141674,"name":"Connoisseur's Inn Wine Stopper with Handmade Diamond Faceted Clear Glass on Top","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bAm3anyAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Practical and Decorative Whether on weddings, anniversaries, dinner parties, holidays or other life events and occasions where wine is served to celebrate, most wine bottles are left partially consumed and open to air affecting wine's freshness. When typical bottle stoppers are nowhere around, jamming stubborn corks back in the bottle every time you stop pouring gets tiresome and messy. This stylish bottle stopper will help keep wine fresh longer and its eye-catching diamond crystal ball will surely make heads of your guests turning. Makes an excellent wedding or general party favor, a gift for dinner hosts or a classy prize to bestow upon wine tasting guests.  The clear crystal on top is cut and polished by skilled craftsmen to take shape of diamond crystal ball. The process of making imbues crystal with good physical properties, perfect for precise cutting, grinding and polishing. Available in different colors, the crystal ball is made of high clarity, low inclusions bubble-free glass known as optical borosilicate crown glass. Being less fragile than typical glass, also used to make high-end chandeliers and its low-dispersal properties and refractive index make it a good choice for optics, camera lenses and prisms for lasers. Products made from crystal glass are quite popular today, offering both durability and high quality at a reasonable price. Use and Care - Twist-in slowly with some wiggling for better sealing - Twist-out slowly with some wiggling for easier removal  On first use, wash under tap water at room-temperature with a drop of mild soap, rinse and allow it to dry. This product is NOT dishwasher-safe .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bAm3anyAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Connoisseur's Inn","source_asin":"B00R4D4QLK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1141674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00R4D4QLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00R4D4QLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
