window.products.push({"id":1141719,"name":"BOSKA Reusable Non-stick Toastabags, Set of 2 Toaster Bags, For Grilled Cheese","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tt9--gJmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Toastabags 2 pieces Boska's bestselling Toastabags are a no-mess, easy, and fast solution for grilled cheese lovers. No more crumbs, no clean up, and easy enough even for kids! A useful invention for making perfect grilled cheese sandwiches in the toaster. - NO MESS: Keeps your toaster clean and crumb-free - NO CROSS-CONTAMINATION: Suitable for a gluten-free diet - REUSABLE: Each bag can be used up to 50x - EASY TO CLEAN: Bags are non-stick and dishwasher safe Simple and versatile Making a grilled cheese sandwich has never been easier. Simply assemble your sandwich, slide it into the Toastabag, and put it into the toaster. You don't even have to butter the bread (if you don't want to). You can also use it in a panini press, keeping it clean. But it doesn't end with grilled cheese sandwiches -use the Toastabag to reheat pizza slices, French fries, hash browns, or pastries in your toaster! Grilled cheese mania Don't just stick with the simplest grilled cheddar cheese -mix it up! Try new combinations. Make an Italian panini with mozzarella, tomatoes, pesto, and basil. Or make it Texas style with cheddar, guacamole, bacon, and crumbled nachos. But don't forget -a sweetened twist is also an option with mascarpone, honey, apple slices, and brown sugar! Maintenance The Toastabags are dishwasher safe and reusable for up to 50 times. Contents - 2 Toastabags About Boska Holland Cheesewares We love cheese! Since 1896, here at Boska, it's been our mission to spread the love of cheese to everyone everywhere. Our innovative family-owned company started as a blacksmith making tools for the cheese farmers in Holland, and now we are the world's only specialist in Cheesewares: cheese tools and accessories. In short: we sell everything you need to enjoy cheese except the cheese itself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tt9--gJmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSKA","source_asin":"B00V6IKFDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1141719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00V6IKFDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00V6IKFDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
