window.products.push({"id":1141738,"name":"MAXYGIFT 8\" Chef Kitchen Knife & Sharpener. High Carbon Stainless Steel Razor Sharp Rust-Free Cutlery Set. Quality Sushi Ergonomic Chef's knife in Gif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tQZ8wEvNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"> MAXYGIFT IS A MULTIPURPOSE KITCHEN TOOL >>> Every chef knows that the key to a good meal lies in having the right tool set. Our finely crafted Japanese style chef knife lets you take your culinary skills to the next level and cuts your prep time in half. > PROFESSIONAL QUALITY CHEF KNIFE >>> Your knives get put through a lot, so you need them to withstand the test of time. Our knife has a Super tough (58-60 HRC), ultralight weight, high carbon (0.6%-0.75%) stainless steel blade that is tarnish and rustproof, and the comfortable ergonomic handle is crafted from durable pakkawood. > COMFORT IN THE KITCHEN >>> Whether you're preparing meals for fun or necessity, this chopping knife makes the experience enjoyable. It is crafted to be functional and comfortable to use with balanced weight, ergonomic grip, and razor-sharp blade. > THE ULTIMATE GIFT FOR EVERYONE >>> Maxygift's knife and BONUS FREE knife sharpener are the perfect presents for beginner or pro cooks. Give it as a wedding gift, an anniversary gift, a housewarming gift, or the Christmas gift to remember. > 100% MONEY BACK AND LIFETIME GUARANTEE >>> Finding the right chef's knife can be a daunting task, especially when buying online. We take the stress out of shopping. If our professional chef knives aren’t cutting it, send them back for a full refund!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tQZ8wEvNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAXYGIFT","source_asin":"B01M1EIJSS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1141738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M1EIJSS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M1EIJSS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1141739,"name":"Objet D'Art Release #415 \"Happy Birthday\" Birthday Cake Handmade Jeweled Metal & Enamel Trinket Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ixoPLHpwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description The clock keeps ticking and once a year the annual cause for celebration your birthday! Many love it, equally loath it as it does signal that we are all getting older; and hopefully wiser! Celebrations bring gifts and messages of goodwill from friends and business associates and family and usually accompany some type of sweet treat. We made just such a treat, a cup cake frosted with a birthday message and candles. This treat you don't eat but it is 100% made by hand to keep forever. From the Manufacturer Artform: n. “An undertaking or activity enhanced by a high level of skill or refinement.” In a world so focused on “advancing” technology, its rare to find a company and product dedicated to “turning back the clock”, by making things of beauty the old fashioned way; by hand. Introducing Artform Fine Collectibles. Based in exciting Las Vegas Nevada, and dedicated to the fine art of imagination. From humble beginnings, we have assembled one of the largest collections of unique collectible trinket boxes in compelling categories of interest, such as our famous “gambling and Vegas”, critically endangered species, “America’s Heroes”, musical instruments, “World Heritage Sites and many many more. There exists a must have product for everyone in this expansive catalogue. Using age-old techniques of metalworking and precision jewelery making, this beautiful line of handmade collectibles embody the dedication and com- mitment of our skilled artisans; making every one we produce, singularily unique; each a keepsake worth cherishing for a lifetime. It all starts with our hundreds of unique designs, inspired by life and forged into miniature. An idea becomes a sketch and the process begins as hand-cast fine pewter is forged into a shell skillfully prepared, precious metal plated, enameled and embellished with fine Austrian crystal, all 100% by hand. “A permanent, tangible expression of love”, we call these beautiful curios. So much more meaningful and expressive than a greeting card. They become the perfect gift; matched to the dreams and passions of the recipient; beautifully packaged in our signature handmade giftbox with embossed certificate of authenticity and fine linen presentation card and matching envelope. Un- matched in quality; a gift worth giving for any occasion. We call all of this “objet d’art”; or “work of art”, limited only by the boundaries of your imagination . . .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ixoPLHpwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Objet d' Art","source_asin":"B0057DDBQU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1141739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0057DDBQU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0057DDBQU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
