window.products.push({"id":1141785,"name":"SUPER DEAL Digital 6 Tray Food Dehydrator with Timer & Thermostat Perfect for Beef Jerky, Herbs, Fruit Meat and Spices (1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cIn9acauL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why choose SUPER DEAL Pro Food Dehydrator? If you grow your own fruits and vegetables, you are able to dry them in season and keep them without the need for additional electrical power such as you would need if they were frozen.  Hikers and campers can take advantage of these devices to dehydrate favorite foods for outdoor activities. They can pack of a lot of good calories and vitamins in a very small and lightweight package that can be rehydrated at any time. Have a little (or big) kid that loves jerky but you don’t love the cost? Make it on the cheap! Use cheaper and leaner cuts of beef and it’ll taste better than store bought. Want to spice up a stew or soup? Throw a few handfuls of dried tomatoes, corn, peppers, etc in the mix and it’ll put a smile on your face. HOW IT WORKS: You place the food on a tray, our machine slowly distributes heated air throughout the mesh-covered trays. It generates a very gentle heat that dries the food at a slow and even rate, preserving the organic matter and preventing “case hardening” on the outside. Case hardening occurs when the fruits, vegetables, or meats are heated too fast, forming a seal on the outside and trapping in moisture. It is very important to remove as much water as possible in the drying process. Specifications: Temperature range: 95°F to 165°F Time setting: 30 minutes to 48 hours  Wattage: 750 W Weight: 8lbs  Power cord length: 31.5inch Temperature&Time Reference: Recommend working at 135 degrees Fahrenheit, working time for 4-6 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cIn9acauL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPER DEAL","source_asin":"B01AFO3N90","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1141785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AFO3N90","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AFO3N90","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1141786,"name":"Paddywax Candles Pattern Play Collection Scented Candle in Decorative Tin, 6.5-Ounce, Pineapple and Ginger","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ILiLKAW9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Striking patterns of chevrons, dots and stripes play with eye-popping colors to create a chic package. Exquisite fragrances fill our gorgeous handmade creamy matte ceramics with pops of color inside. Our Pattern Play is beautifully dressed ready for gifting. Paddywax, an artisan candle company, is known for its innovative fragrances and fresh style. All of our Candles are proudly made in the U.S.A. Every candle is hand treated from start to finish, giving each piece a personal touch. Paddywax boasts a variety of candle collections satisfying any candle need from décor to gifting to just indulgence and is not that what candles are really about? The process of making Paddywax candles is artisan in every sense, closely resembling techniques used to make candles hundreds of years ago. From fragrance throw to burn time, each custom recipe is made to deliver the best experience. Our fragrance blends are developed to distribute the most natural aroma through the use of all natural ingredients. We take pride in never offering a synthetic fragrance; instead we constantly push ourselves to create something natural and unique. It begins when every candle is hand poured and ends when each product is packaged with precision. Each bow and label are applied by hand to give every product that human touch that is worthy of gift giving. We take pride in our work and know that every detail counts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ILiLKAW9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paddywax Candles","source_asin":"B00BJ5RGCA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1141786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BJ5RGCA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BJ5RGCA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
