window.products.push({"id":1141814,"name":"NUDASHOP Turkish Bowls Hand Painted Set of 6 - 2.5oz Charcuterie Board Accessories - Finger Bowls - Small Prep Bowls, Tiny Bowls, Dipping Bowls - Smal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d5KXXvgUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ceramic: Ceramic’s raw material is clay, which goes through several processes such as molding by hand and baking in an oven to turn into the beloved kitchen utensil we use today. Hand painted Turkish pottery is an important part of Turkish culture, and despite claiming that it is a kitchen utensil, tiny bowls can be used both for decorative bowls and everyday use. Materials and Characteristics: Turkish ceramic bowls are made from fire resistant material. They are eco- friendly and not easily become deformed. Being waterproof and easily washable, pinch bowls can also add an aesthetic aura to your chosen place of use. Size and Color: Width: 3.14\" (8 cm), Length: 1.57\" (4 cm), Depth: 1.18\" (3 cm). Hand painted small ceramic bowls which each have their own unique design, are sold in packages of 6. These 6 small dipping bowls will reach you with color options green, yellow, orange, purple, blue and turquoise. Use to serve sauce/dip/cheese and as a prep bowl holding herbs and spices when cooking. You can use as tapas bowls, spice bowls, sauce bowls, dip cups, charcuterie bowls or charcuterie board accessories. Area of Usage: The various color options and small decorative bowl harmony with each other will enable you to create extraordinary table settings and decorations. Use them to serve olives or other small appetizers, serve sauce-dip-cheese, as a prep bowl holding herbs and spices when cooking. Use in the bathroom, office, or bedroom to hold jewelers items overnight or use to hold paint for a creative project. A Perfect Choice as a Gift: Our small finger bowls comes in securely wrapped boxes. This Turkish decor aims to become your first choice as a bathroom, office, or bedroom to hold jewelers items or hold paint for a creative. You can use as a gift housewarming, wedding, mother’s day gifts for your loved ones, or for yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d5KXXvgUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NUDASHOP","source_asin":"B09Q6G1Z9X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1141814","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q6G1Z9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q6G1Z9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
