window.products.push({"id":1141838,"name":"LILYSILK Silk Pillowcase for Hair 100 Mulberry Silk 1pc 25 Momme Charmeuse Double-Side Silk Fabric Gift Box (Standard, Ivory)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V1fGUvXAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MADE OF LUXURIOUS 25 MOMME 100% MULBERRY SILK: LILYSILK's 25 Momme pillowcase is ultimate bedroom solution to your sleep-related beauty needs. With a 750 thread count, the 25 Momme pillowcases offer much greater durability than even the 22 Momme products, all the while providing effective treatments for your facial wrinkles, sleep lines, and messy/broken morning hair. Despite the higher price, the added shelf life makes these pillowcases the most cost-efficient purchase on LilySilk. STRONG AND DURABLE: Include 1Pc silk pillowcase. Size: Standard 20x26inches(51cmx66cm); The Terse styled features a simplistic flange-less design with a side-opened envelope closure for those who like to put their hands under their pillowcases when they sleep. With beautiful silk sheen, great choice for adding style to your bedroom. 750 thread count, 45% more silk than 19 momme, a sensuously smooth, strong, breathable natural fiber. OEKO CERTIFIED, PURE SILK: Oeko-tex 100 certified To Be Free Of Chemicals And Naturally Dyed With No Color Shading Or Fading. Durable for many years use. Smooth, soft, breathable. Great for preventing facial and neck wrinkles, dry skin, tangled hair, and bed head. Unlike cotton or satin, silk won't soak up your expensive night/eye creams. It leaves your face's natural moisture and oils intact. A great gift for anyone who enjoys deep, restorative sleep. HIGH QUALITY CRAFTSMANSHIP &DESIGN: Beautiful silk sheen with strong seam. Crafted by experienced silk makers and made of fresh silk worms not stoked one. Envelope closure is designed to prevent any occasional scratchings of metal/plastic zippers so the silk lasts longer. With 25 momme pure mulberry silk on both side keeps your skin and hair healthy. Beautiful gift box. Perfect gift idea for her and special occasions like Valentine’s Day, Christmas or anniversaries. EASY CARE & DURABLE - Our luxury silk pillow cases can be tossed right into the washing machine without the fear of fading or shrinkage. Machine washed on a gentle cycle in cold water with silk-friendly detergent and air dry. 25 mm silk has the durability to last up to ten years with the proper care and laundering.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V1fGUvXAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LilySilk","source_asin":"B087G3LTQV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1141838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087G3LTQV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087G3LTQV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
